 "description": "Dissolve",
 "notes": "TOOL, operator `dissolve` (rapier_op 5). Solvent. The film does not fade evenly, it breaks up, and what it breaks into is the paper: the gate is the painting's own sheet in absolute paper coordinates, so the pattern does not crawl under the finger and a second pass eats exactly where the first did. Coverage only ever falls.\n\nAuthor: Rapier\nLicense: AGPL-3.0-only",
